decoder on stock Diffusers blocks and copies no Michelangelo source.

Not included: upstream files carrying the Tencent Hunyuan 3D non-commercial
license header (step1x3d_geometry/models/autoencoders/volume_decoders.py and
the texture-stage custom_rasterizer and differentiable_renderer). Occupancy is
evaluated on a dense grid written for this package instead of upstream's
hierarchical volume decoder. pymeshlab (GPL) post-processing is not used.

